  {
   "thing": {
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "FIBONACCI\n\nThe robot marked Fib copies\nITSELF: it takes one off the\nnumber, copies its own box\nthrough Mimi twice, builds\ntwo houses, and puts a copy\nof itself in each. Robots\nthat reach 1 or 2 mail a\nsingle 1 to the nest."
   },
   "x": -1.05,
   "z": 2.15
  },
  {
   "thing": {
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "TO RUN IT\n\n1. Give the five-hole box to\n   the Fib robot.\n2. Watch the houses appear\n   and smoke. fib(8) makes\n   forty of them, six deep.\n3. When the smoke stops, the\n   nest holds 21 ones.\n4. Give the [0, nest] box to\n   the Sum robot: it adds\n   them up to 21."
   },
   "x": -0.05,
   "z": 2.15
  }
